---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Starship Kepler"
    description="An intense arcade shooter that encourages movement and variety. Pilot a lone starship through waves of vivid geometric enemies, weaving through danger while your weapons carve color across the void."
    image="/images/starship-kepler-1232-706.png"
>
    <div class="hero">
        <img
            src="/images/starship-kepler-3840-1240.png"
            alt="Starship Kepler"
            class="hero-banner"
        />
    </div>

    <main>
        <article>
            <div class="game-header">
                <img
                    src="/images/starship-kepler-icon-256x256.png"
                    alt="Starship Kepler icon"
                    class="game-icon"
                />
                <div class="game-title-block">
                    <h1>Starship Kepler</h1>
                    <p class="tagline">
                        An intense arcade shooter that encourages movement and
                        variety.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <section class="trailer">
                <div class="video-wrapper">
                    <iframe
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/RagZE3vSjbw"
                        title="Starship Kepler trailer"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                        allowfullscreen
                    ></iframe>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="wishlist-cta">
                <p class="wishlist-heading">Available on Steam</p>
                <p class="wishlist-sub">Wishlist now to be notified when it launches.</p>
                <a
                    href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2003100/Starship_Kepler"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="wishlist-btn"
                >
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Wishlist on Steam
                </a>
            </section>

            <section class="description">
                <p>
                    You play as a lost-in-space starship: Kepler, contending
                    with an endless barrage of geometric shapes. Pilot a lone
                    starship through waves of vivid geometric enemies, weaving
                    through danger while your weapons carve color across the
                    void.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Every fight is fast, readable, and score-hungry: dodge by a
                    hair, clear the screen, grab what you can, and keep moving.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Your ship is shaped by elements. Collect and combine powers
                    to change how you fight — from familiar projectile weapons
                    to stranger builds like sustained beams, chained lightning,
                    reflective weaponry, and fire. The right element can turn a
                    desperate screen into a comeback.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="modes">
                <div class="mode-row">
                    <div class="mode-text">
                        <h2>Free Play</h2>
                        <p>
                            Travel outward through a strange and hostile deep
                            space, following signals, triggering anomalies, and
                            uncovering a quiet cosmic story told between
                            battles.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <img
                        src="/images/freeplay-gif.gif"
                        alt="Free Play gameplay"
                        class="mode-gif"
                    />
                </div>
                <div class="mode-row reverse">
                    <div class="mode-text">
                        <h2>Quick Play</h2>
                        <p>
                            Confined to a morphing cage, survive for as long as
                            you can and beat your high score. Immediate, brutal,
                            and endlessly replayable.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <img
                        src="/images/quickplay-gif.gif"
                        alt="Quick Play gameplay"
                        class="mode-gif"
                    />
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="features">
                <h2>Features</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fast twin-stick arcade combat</li>
                    <li>Difficult</li>
                    <li>Short, arcade style gameplay</li>
                    <li>Free Play with escalating anomalies and boss encounters</li>
                    <li>Quick Play for immediate score-chasing survival</li>
                    <li>Elemental weapon builds that change your attack style</li>
                    <li>
                        Bright, minimalist visuals built around clarity, motion,
                        and impact
                    </li>
                    <li>A lonely sci-fi atmosphere beneath the chaos</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="links">
                <h2>Links</h2>
                <div class="link-list">
                    <a href="https://discord.gg/tMW3YU2z6r" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-item">
                        <svg class="link-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057c.002.022.015.04.036.052a19.94 19.94 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .036-.052c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span>Join the Discord</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2003100/Starship_Kepler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-item">
                        <svg class="link-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M11.979 0C5.678 0 .511 4.86.022 11.037l6.432 2.658c.545-.371 1.203-.59 1.912-.59.063 0 .125.004.188.006l2.861-4.142V8.91c0-2.495 2.028-4.523 4.524-4.523 2.494 0 4.524 2.031 4.524 4.527s-2.03 4.525-4.524 4.525h-.105l-4.076 2.911c0 .052.004.105.004.159 0 1.875-1.515 3.396-3.39 3.396-1.635 0-3.016-1.173-3.331-2.711L.436 16.476C1.862 20.868 6.598 24 11.979 24c6.627 0 11.999-5.373 11.999-12S18.606 0 11.979 0zM7.54 18.21l-1.473-.61c.262.543.714.999 1.314 1.25 1.297.539 2.793-.076 3.332-1.375.263-.63.264-1.319.005-1.949s-.75-1.121-1.377-1.383c-.624-.26-1.29-.249-1.878-.03l1.523.63c.956.4 1.409 1.5 1.009 2.455-.397.957-1.497 1.41-2.454 1.012H7.54zm11.415-9.303c0-1.662-1.353-3.015-3.015-3.015-1.665 0-3.015 1.353-3.015 3.015 0 1.665 1.35 3.015 3.015 3.015 1.662 0 3.015-1.35 3.015-3.015zm-5.273-.005c0-1.252 1.013-2.266 2.265-2.266 1.249 0 2.266 1.014 2.266 2.266 0 1.251-1.017 2.265-2.266 2.265-1.252 0-2.265-1.014-2.265-2.265z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span>Steam</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <p class="closing-line">
                Burn brighter. Push farther. Something out there is listening.
            </p>
        </article>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .hero {
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        max-height: 320px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: #000;
    }

    .hero-banner {
        width: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center;
        display: block;
    }

    main {
        margin: auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        max-width: 90ch;
        color: #aaaaaa;
    }

    main article {
        font-family: "Open Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .game-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .game-icon {
        width: 96px;
        height: 96px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        image-rendering: pixelated;
    }

    .game-title-block h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .tagline {
        color: #aaaaaa;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .description {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .description p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    }

    .trailer {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .video-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 56.25%;
        height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        border: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .video-wrapper iframe {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .modes {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .mode-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .mode-row.reverse {
        direction: rtl;
    }

    .mode-row.reverse .mode-text {
        direction: ltr;
    }

    .mode-text h2 {
        color: #f15125;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        direction: ltr;
    }

    .mode-text p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        direction: ltr;
    }

    .mode-gif {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: 0.375rem;
        display: block;
        border: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .features {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .features h2 {
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .features ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.4rem 2rem;
    }

    .features ul li {
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
        position: relative;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .features ul li::before {
        content: "—";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: #f15125;
    }

    .screenshots {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .screenshots h2 {
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .screenshot-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .screenshot {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: 0.375rem;
        display: block;
        border: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .screenshot.wide {
        grid-column: span 2;
    }

    .screenshot.portrait {
        object-fit: cover;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    .wishlist-cta {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border: 1px solid #f15125;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(241, 81, 37, 0.05);
    }

    .wishlist-heading {
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    }

    .wishlist-sub {
        color: #aaaaaa;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    }

    .wishlist-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
        background: #f15125;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
    }

    .wishlist-btn:hover {
        background: #d4431e;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .wishlist-btn svg {
        width: 1.1rem;
        height: 1.1rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .links {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .links h2 {
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .link-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .link-item {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #eeeeee;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    a.link-item:hover {
        border-color: #f15125;
        background-color: rgba(241, 81, 37, 0.07);
        color: #f15125;
    }

    .link-item--disabled {
        opacity: 0.45;
        cursor: default;
    }

    .link-icon {
        width: 1.1rem;
        height: 1.1rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .coming-soon {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #666;
        margin-left: 0.25rem;
    }

    .closing-line {
        color: #555;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .game-header {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .mode-row,
        .mode-row.reverse {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            direction: ltr;
        }

        .features ul {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .screenshot-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .screenshot.wide {
            grid-column: span 1;
        }
    }
</style>
